</script></span> </div>
                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 22pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">遵照市委、市教育局党委相关要求，1月</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">18</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">下</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">午，绍兴一中党委班子举行</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党史学习教育专题</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">民主生活会。市教育局党委书记、局长姚国海出席会议并讲话，市教育局办公室</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">副</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主任</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">解明远</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">出席会议。会议由校党委书记、校长王琛主持，校党委</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">全体成员参加。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会议牢牢把握民主生活会</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">主题</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">聚焦主题内涵，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持把政治建设摆在首位，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">按照“学史明理、学史增信、学史崇德、学史力行”和“学党史、悟思想、办实事、开新局”的目标要求，围绕《通知》明确的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">5个方面进行对照检查，深入查摆问题，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">严肃开展</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">批评与自我批评，进一步深化学习教育、统一思想认识、剖析问题根源、推动整改落实。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">会上，王琛首先通报了20</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">20</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年度学校班子民主生活会整改措施落实情况和本次民主生活会征求意见情况，代表学校领导班子作了对照检查，也盘点了收获，同时阐述了班子存在的问题，并对问题进行了根源剖析，提出了整改措施。其他班子成员根据存在的问题当场认领了相关工作责任。在此基础上，党委班子成员逐一进行了对照检查发言，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">深刻</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">自我批评</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并接受其他</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班子成员</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的批评意见建议</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚国海在听取了学校领导班子检视报告和班子成员个人发言后，对本次民主生活会作了深刻点评。他充分肯定了本次民主生活会准备充分，检视深刻，对推进工作很有帮助。对班子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2021</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年的工作，他用“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">五点感受</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”做了高度评价：一是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">党史学习教育严实</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，二是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">班子团结务实</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，三是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学秩序稳实</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，四是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">整改措施落实</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，五是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">办学成绩茁实。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后，他指出班子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“四个方面”的问题整改：一是“对标优良，教风还要更严谨”，二是“对标先进，竞赛还要更出彩”，三是“对标第一，高分群还要更拓展”，四是“对标期盼，形象还要更优化”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。针对202</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">年的工作，他提出“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四点要求</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">：</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">一是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">坚持“稳进提质”总基调</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">做到稳思想、稳秩序、稳安全；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">二是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">突出“先”的导向</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">以先进的教师、先导的节奏、领先的成绩、先进的制度，巩固好一中的发展态势；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三是</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">强化“以人民为中心”的理念</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">谋划好学校的未来发展；</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">四是加强</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">队伍建设，多措并举，培育、激励更多一中名师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">在聆听点评后，王琛代表班子作表态发言和会议总结。他指出，通过民主生活会，进一步明确了存在的问题及其根源。他强调，要进一步梳理完善本次会议检视问题的整改方案，做好</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">姚局长讲话</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">精神在全校范围的学习传达</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，并在</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">2022年学校工作计划中进一步贯彻落实</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"></span></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/1/202201261608515691.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202201261608515691.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/1/202201261609009815.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202201261609009815.JPG" /></p><p><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2022/1/202201261609027764.JPG" style="max-width: 100%; " title="202201261609027764.JPG" /></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.39in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">
</span>
</p>
    
